{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24594","headline":"闲题家池寄王屋张道士 · 白居易","name":"闲题家池寄王屋张道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有石白磷磷，有水清潺潺。\n有叟头似雪，婆娑乎其间。\n进不趋要路，退不入深山。\n深山太濩落，要路多险艰。\n不如家池上，乐逸无忧患。\n有食适吾口，有酒酡吾颜。\n恍惚游醉乡，希夷造玄关。\n五千言下悟，十二年来闲。\n富者我不顾，贵者我不攀。\n唯有天坛子，时来一往还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}